# An allowlist (ADR-046): the build context is only what the image build
# reads. Everything else, including any file added to the repo later, stays
# out unless it is named here.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!tsconfig.build.json
!src/

# Named again, last, because the last matching line wins: a "!" line added
# above can never let these back in. .env holds the provider key; eval/
# holds the held-out set, which must never ship (ADR-021); models/ is
# mounted at run time, never baked (ADR-046). scripts/docker-smoke.ts checks
# the built image, not this file.
**/.env
**/.env.*
eval/
test/
docs/
dev_docs/
scripts/
models/
**/held-out.txt
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.head-worktree/
.machine-samples/
.mutation-in-progress.json
names-result.json
*.log
